"Tutorial text" = "
Usage:
1. Click the Main Toggle (\"<\") to expand / collapse the status bar.
2. Hold Option key (\"⌥\") while clicking the Main Toggle (\"<\") to reveal always hidden items.
3. Right-click (Control-click) the Main Toggle (\"<\") to show Context Menu.

Edit Mode:
1. Check \"Edit Mode\" in Context Menu to enter edit mode.
2. In edit mode, sperators between sections are shown.
   Rearrange the status bar items into sections as needed.
   (Hold Command key (\"⌘\") to drag icons.)
3. Exit the edit mode by clicking the Main Toggle (\"<\") or unchecking \"Edit Mode\" in Context Menu.
";
